{"id":878557,"title":"01︱实例演示：AI智能体会进化到何种形态","content":"AI智能体正在改变人类与电子设备的交互方式，包括手机、电脑、平板、手表及未来的汽车等。比尔·盖茨曾预言AI智能体会彻底改变计算机使用模式，这一预言正逐渐成为现实。通过结合RPA（软件流程自动化）和MCP技术，AI智能体能够理解自然语言指令，自动规划并执行任务。例如，用户可指示AI为特定联系人的朋友圈点赞或在淘宝下单购买商品。这些操作展示了AI数字员工如何自动完成从搜索到支付的全过程。未来，AI智能体将不仅限于简化日常任务，还将重塑各行各业的工作模式，使软件和硬件的应用形态发生根本性变化。这意味着我们正从依赖工具的时代过渡到由AI助理主导的新时代，在这个时代里，通过自然语言指令即可驱动AI智能体理解和执行复杂任务，从而提高效率并解放人力。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":400548,"user_name":"实数","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2637725,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"697BEAFCE929D2","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/28/3f/9d/c59c12ad.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1748309521,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"老师  我买过你的另一门AI课程  当时用的fastgpt 但是现在转用dify了。ai领域工具变化如此频繁  我们如何平衡再学习和复用呢","like_count":4},{"had_liked":false,"id":400435,"user_name":"行与修","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1241842,"ip_address":"重庆","ucode":"11F21B663EF6D3","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/f2/f2/2a9a6e9a.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1747798834,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"周总保护好隐私啊 : )  \n一座美丽的城市！","like_count":4},{"had_liked":false,"id":404700,"user_name":"幽弥狂","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1019807,"ip_address":"天津","ucode":"5AECEA7D6ADF33","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/8f/9f/e49b68ea.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1768242791,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":1,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"老师这是一点码都不带打的","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":405295,"user_name":"Geek_9ced33","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2883774,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"36FF1C0C6EBEFF","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1770861301,"is_pvip":false,"replies":n